&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="vector-pdf"&gt;Vector PDF&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="vector-pdf"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#vector-pdf" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;In v0.4.0 the PDF is drawn as vectors (see
&lt;a href="https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.13/cli/#vector-pdf"&gt;Command line&lt;/a&gt;). Same machine and method,
2026-10-19:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Deck&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;go-slides&lt;/th&gt;
