&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Memory for the 100-slide PDF: 158 MiB, against 1,512 MiB for marp-cli; CPU
time 0.9 s against 2.7 s.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The v0.4.0 figures for the 100-slide PDF were measured on 2026-10-19 at 21:29,
with a 1-minute load average of 7.7, over three rounds: go-slides 306 ms, 758
KiB and 158 MiB; marp-cli 1,838 ms, 837 KiB and 1,512 MiB.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="editable-pptx"&gt;Editable PPTX&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="editable-pptx"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#editable-pptx" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Since v0.5.0 the PPTX is made of text boxes, shapes and pictures (see
&lt;a href="https://go-slides.github.io/docs/0.13/cli/#editable-pptx-and-odp"&gt;Command line&lt;/a&gt;). Measured on
2026-10-19 at 22:51, with a 1-minute load average of 7.1, over three rounds:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Deck&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;go-slides&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;marp-cli&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;go-slides size&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;marp-cli size&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;go-slides memory&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th style="text-align: right"&gt;marp-cli memory&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;100 slides&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;348 ms&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;7,795 ms&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="text-align: right"&gt;760 KiB&lt;/td&gt;
